*> The chunk feed of the players (core/src/chunk-feed.cob): when a dimension's chunks are generated by the time-sliced queue (GEN-QUEUE-SLICED), the chunks of a player's view are
*> not generated inside the join or the move: the feed asks the queue for the nearest ones and sends each chunk when the queue has finished it. EXTERNAL; one slot per player row.
*> CF-SENT of a slot is the flag of every chunk of the square of CF-D around (CF-CX, CF-CZ), index (dz + CF-D) * (2 * CF-D + 1) + dx + CF-D + 1 for the offset (dx, dz) from the center:
*> 0 not sent, 1 sent. CF-MAX-D bounds the view distance the feed serves (a larger configured distance is clamped to it).
 78 CF-MAX-D             VALUE 22.
 78 CF-CELLS             VALUE 2025.
 78 CF-SENDS             VALUE 2.
 78 CF-LOOKS             VALUE 12.
 01 CHUNK-FEED EXTERNAL.
    05 CF-SLOT OCCURS 64 TIMES.
       10 CF-ACTIVE         BINARY-LONG.
       10 CF-DIM            BINARY-LONG.
       10 CF-CX             BINARY-LONG.
       10 CF-CZ             BINARY-LONG.
       10 CF-D              BINARY-LONG.
       10 CF-SENT           BINARY-LONG OCCURS 2025 TIMES.
